        "Invest active constituent service in the 7.80% Black, 9.14% Hispanic, and 2.49% Asian communities; coalition math in HD-85 depends on minority turnout and enthusiasm, not assumed loyalty, and the gap between demographic presence and electoral engagement is the most available variable in the margin",
        "Engage the 39% Republican opposition as professional moderates, not ideological opponents — small-business owners, independent professionals, and fiscally-oriented voters who evaluate on policy quality are the swing constituency that determines whether 61% holds or erodes",
        "Treat the ~11% AIAN gap as a real constituent population; Native American residents have specific governance expectations around tribal-state relations and economic development that warrant authentic engagement rather than assumption of partisan alignment"
